# This is a monorepo — backend/ and frontend/ each keep their own .gitignore
# for language-specific rules. This root file only covers cross-cutting,
# repo-wide concerns so patterns don't accidentally collide between the two
# (e.g. a Python-style bare `lib/` rule swallowing frontend/src/lib).

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Env files (never commit secrets; each app's *.env.example stays tracked)
.env
.env.local

# AI pairing context — local-only from here on, not part of the shared repo.
# Anchored to root: a bare `CLAUDE.md` pattern matches at any depth and would
# also swallow frontend/CLAUDE.md (an unrelated Next.js tooling pointer file).
/CLAUDE.md
